{"unit_id":"DashingMonkey__dsh-git-panel#feature-1","repo":"DashingMonkey/dsh-git-panel","commit":"5cfddf62b12f35e3f538188b6c85bd693d7280fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Git Panel 的功能「工作区仓库面板」：随当前工作区扫描并列出 Git 仓库，用户可从侧栏按钮打开面板，点击变更文件查看差异，并通过仓库卡片进入 Git 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:93-100","src/client/components/GitPanelMain.js:107-124","src/client/components/GitPanelMain.js:234-245"]}
{"unit_id":"DashingMonkey__dsh-git-panel#feature-2","repo":"DashingMonkey/dsh-git-panel","commit":"5cfddf62b12f35e3f538188b6c85bd693d7280fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Git Panel 的功能「生成提交信息草稿」：用户可基于选定文件请求生成提交说明；插件读取对应 Git diff，并使用 DSH 当前可用的模型与规则生成文本供用户填写。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1503-1551","src/host.js:2287-2306"]}
{"unit_id":"DashingMonkey__dsh-git-panel#caveat-1","repo":"DashingMonkey/dsh-git-panel","commit":"5cfddf62b12f35e3f538188b6c85bd693d7280fc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Git Panel 使用模型生成提交信息时，会将仓库名、分支名、所选文件名及相应 diff 放入提交提示上下文，再交给 DSH 当前选用的模型服务；具体服务取决于 DSH 的模型配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1517-1551","src/host.js:1542-1549"]}
